{"title":"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For a sale, a store owner reduces the price of a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1af88c1534bab510152766fb60851db0c3a5af52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> scarf by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />.  Later the price is lowered again, this time by one-half the reduced price.  The price is now\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/a/2da0621be0fe089ebd50ca5504c8e1c0ded18dfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\$2.00 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\$3.75 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\$4.00 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\  \\$4.90 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\$6.40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"494\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After the first discount, the price of the scarf is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/0/ab00f6fbc28752a39bb212c28edf8d5672adb4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8 \\cdot \\$10 = \\$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" />.  \n</p><p>After the second discount, the price is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/e/90e008a8d5fc19cb1ea6c377eba5cdbc5c137fb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\$8 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$4.00}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first discount multiplies the price by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/1/7516f45cf9b645c872b6e019602da50356f94400.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - 0.2 = 0.8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />, while the second discount multiplies the price by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />.  So the two discounts multiply the price by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/c/3ec267e674334fb4c05c85ff29a5d6d98747df2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} = 0.4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"38\" />, and thus the final price of the scarf is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/9/7e9c03454e07d42da2d4f442520011c7d99e35ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.4 \\cdot \\$10 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$4.00}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"177\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME\" title=\"1998 AJHSME\">1998 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1